{"steam_appid":2317290,"steam_name":"EvoCreo 2","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2317290/145493456/01949afaa385c6886a6cd5f478c89fda7cdec888/1772888568/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772891466","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257299047/8a71b75e7ddb97171dcde524ac10d08b50efb92b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772891466","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/c101fb5f35ed3ce74778f9016bcbd67551e03f27/ss_c101fb5f35ed3ce74778f9016bcbd67551e03f27.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787073313","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/ss_12bf742bccb3f986da4c850389db5d60db0f8bdf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787073313","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/ss_1a15a4b305a2a35a1d123379800e5b52fd453cac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787073313","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/8da0dfc11deb2a8efce89472d17f2ad7903dd771/ss_8da0dfc11deb2a8efce89472d17f2ad7903dd771.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787073313","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/f602e1bbd844d54c00f206c478929cf537f3bcd3/ss_f602e1bbd844d54c00f206c478929cf537f3bcd3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787073313"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/12591eee5393fe14aa16952e30a16319.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/12591eee5393fe14aa16952e30a16319.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the captivating handcrafted pixel-art world of Shoru, a land inhabited by powerful creatures known as Creo. These majestic creatures have existed for millennia and yet their origins remain shrouded in mystery. <strong>Work alongside Creo companions to discover the truth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/2cbf9a74f558b796f31c56a10bae0ed2.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/2cbf9a74f558b796f31c56a10bae0ed2.webm?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/2cbf9a74f558b796f31c56a10bae0ed2.mp4?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/f4838be404f116a1ea947aae317ba550.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/f4838be404f116a1ea947aae317ba550.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey as a new cadet in the Shoru Police Academy. Investigate the mysterious disappearances of Creo across the land. <strong>Thwart nefarious plots, uncover ancient secrets, and explore the continent of Shoru</strong> with more than 50 missions expanding the world and its lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/bacfa31efa38fbe827442b465e5c7234.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/bacfa31efa38fbe827442b465e5c7234.webm?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/bacfa31efa38fbe827442b465e5c7234.mp4?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/c426964fb1bd4e97af0977253dd114e7.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/c426964fb1bd4e97af0977253dd114e7.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over <strong>300 extraordinary Creo</strong> to capture and befriend along the journey. Assemble powerful teams, experiment with synergies, and find your favorite combinations. Find Creo in <strong>multiple color variations</strong>—collect them all and make a special one-of-a-kind team. Whether you prefer <strong>brute strength, tactical control, or status effects</strong>, there’s a Creo to match every strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9538fabf7fc6db979fab5d5092df8a87.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9538fabf7fc6db979fab5d5092df8a87.webm?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9538fabf7fc6db979fab5d5092df8a87.mp4?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/75a10f09101271169512832290cf1ec5.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/75a10f09101271169512832290cf1ec5.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience over <strong>30 hours</strong> of offline gameplay in a stunningly crafted pixel-art world. Step into hidden caves, walk through bustling cities, or tiptoe through active volcanoes. Witness all of Shoru’s lively biomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9e26516b3f41c8edccab9526aee72de1.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9e26516b3f41c8edccab9526aee72de1.webm?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/9e26516b3f41c8edccab9526aee72de1.mp4?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/95427ce8deca108d3dfd736f905673de.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/95427ce8deca108d3dfd736f905673de.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize over <strong>100 traits, equippable items, and 200+ unique moves</strong> to power up Creo for an upcoming boss fight or competing with friends in PvP battle. Prepare your Creo companions to become victorious against any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/c67675662444a03054e72ff8d853f1f5.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/c67675662444a03054e72ff8d853f1f5.webm?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/c67675662444a03054e72ff8d853f1f5.mp4?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/becb08868ae17b6d4f0b055360e95768.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/becb08868ae17b6d4f0b055360e95768.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle fellow cadets across the globe in <strong>Online Ranked Battles</strong>, or <strong>challenge your friends</strong> in casual matches. Prefer a solo experience? <strong>You can enjoy the full adventure completely offline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/0bf305f21abf8fd44cbb217ee403f178.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/0bf305f21abf8fd44cbb217ee403f178.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful Evokers across Shoru’s many locales and rise to the top to <strong>conquer the Coliseum</strong>. Only the best of the best can earn the coveted title of <strong>Evoking Master</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/a1a2c73abd183b901689e971a5bfc028.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/a1a2c73abd183b901689e971a5bfc028.webm?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/a1a2c73abd183b901689e971a5bfc028.mp4?t=1787073313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/5e6a78a237633bff170a7082cd6b0a1a.apng?t=1787073313\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317290/extras/5e6a78a237633bff170a7082cd6b0a1a.poster.avif?t=1787073313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 30+ hours of offline story-driven gameplay<br>• Over 300 Creo to capture, train, and evolve<br>• No level caps on your monsters<br>• Deep battle mechanics with hundreds of moves and traits <br>• Competitive online battles and ranked matchmaking  [Coming Soon]<br>• Fully offline-capable — no internet required <br>• Multiple color variants for every Creo</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Sports","Strategy"],"developers":["Ilmfinity Studios"],"publishers":["Ilmfinity Studios"],"release_date":"Apr 6, 2026"}